  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD Power sector support UkrEnergo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD Crisis Response Special Fund - immediate support to electricity sector. The contribution goes towards supporing UkrEnergo to fund necessary costs to ensure the continued operation of transmission lines, including to undertake necessary emergency repairs and maintenance. A portion of the funds is available to service payment obligations to producers of renewable energy for the power they provide.</narrative>
  </description>
